# Okta-injected Info.plist — written by the `Inject Okta Config` pre-build
# script from the four OKTA_* env vars on the build machine. May contain
# real tenant values (client ID, issuer) on a developer laptop, so it must
# NEVER be tracked. The committed template is `AcmeBank/Info.plist.example`;
# the pre-build script seeds `AcmeBank/Info.plist` from it on a fresh clone.
AcmeBank/Info.plist
